sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant SRCtrl as ServingRuntime<br/>Controller
    participant PredCtrl as Predictor<br/>Controller
    participant SvcCtrl as Service<br/>Controller
    participant etcd as etcd<br/>Model Placement
    participant RuntimePod as ModelMesh<br/>Runtime Pod
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Operator

    Note over User, Prometheus: Flow 1: ServingRuntime Creation & Validation
    User->>K8sAPI: CREATE ServingRuntime CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: AdmissionReview (POST /validate-...)<br/>TLS on port 9443
    Webhook->>Webhook: Validate multiModel config:<br/>autoscaler class, replicas,<br/>target utilization (1-100)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: AdmissionResponse (allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created / rejected

    Note over User, Prometheus: Flow 2: ServingRuntime Reconciliation
    K8sAPI->>SRCtrl: Watch event: ServingRuntime
    SRCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET Namespace, ConfigMap, Secret<br/>TLS 1.2+
    SRCtrl->>K8sAPI: CREATE/UPDATE Deployment<br/>(runtime pods with ModelMesh sidecar)
    SRCtrl->>etcd: Register runtime for<br/>model placement coordination

    Note over User, Prometheus: Flow 3: Predictor Lifecycle
    User->>K8sAPI: CREATE Predictor CR
    K8sAPI->>PredCtrl: Watch event: Predictor
    PredCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET InferenceService state<br/>TLS 1.2+
    PredCtrl->>etcd: Model placement request
    etcd-->>PredCtrl: Placement decision
    PredCtrl->>RuntimePod: gRPC: Load model<br/>(via Endpoints-based resolver)
    RuntimePod-->>PredCtrl: Model loaded
    PredCtrl->>K8sAPI: UPDATE Predictor status

    Note over User, Prometheus: Flow 4: Service & Monitoring Setup
    K8sAPI->>SvcCtrl: Watch event: Deployment ready
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: CREATE headless Service
    SvcCtrl->>K8sAPI: CREATE ServiceMonitor
    Prometheus->>RuntimePod: Scrape metrics

    Note over User, Prometheus: Flow 5: CRD Conversion
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /convert<br/>Predictor CRD conversion<br/>TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Converted resource
